                <p>Regional Gathering was held from February 27 to March 1 at the Highland Springs resort. It was chaired by Judy Mandel.</p>
<p>Stratton Lindenmeyer began a monthly activity on March 14 called &quot;Urban Hike&quot;, to walk both sides of a long street or street segment, often with a brunch/lunch afterward. Activity continued for 17 years, and in every instance the average slope of the walk was zero.</p>
