<p>Craig Moseley became the first Area Secretary for &#39;Mid-City&#39; effective May 1. Steve Bein became the first Area Delegate for &#39;Coastal&#39;, which grew from the previous &#39;Southwest&#39; Area. Diana Altman became the first Area Secretary for Harbor.</p>
<p>Mel Anderson became the Chair on May 1. John and VeraLouise Pfeiffer shared the role of Ombudsman.</p>
