<p>Beverly Miller resigned as Secretary on October 5 for cataract surgery.</p>
<p>At a Board meeting conducted in a parking lot for our having gotten locked out of the Coast Savings bank building in Toluca Lake, new GLAAM member Jonathan Elliott was appointed to the Board on November 2 and elected as Secretary. He served for over five consecutive years in the latter role, in addition to three subsequent tenures.</p>
