<p>We conducted another successful in-person Regional Gathering at the Golden Sails Hotel in Long Beach, from February 16-18, chaired by Jay Friedlander and Madeline Walker. Attendance again exceeded our budgetary projection, and we made $1400 on the event.</p>
<p>Historian position was retired on April 6; function of updating the History section of the website was reposed with the Awards Committee. Archivist was redefined as a temporary position to perform short-term projects of scanning our physical archives, curating the remainder, and posting applicable documents to the website; function of updating the several Motions Catalogs was reposed with a new position of Motions Chronicler.</p>
